   SmartHomeEnv.lock_unlock(data, ["front_door"])

   # To lock a door:
   SmartHomeEnv.lock_lock(data, ["front_door"])

   # To toggle a door's lock state:
   SmartHomeEnv.lock_toggle(data, ["front_door"])
   ```
